# PACK-T: PACK_N tenants of Fable's profile T, tiny/idle (streams-cost report
# 2026-10-24 §4.1), packed onto one launch-posture cell, to price a tenant at
# scale (README "Packing"). Tenants mode: tenants/pack-t-NNNN.json's projects
# (PACK_N = 1, 100, 400 or 1000; 1,000 is cell-admin's default
# --max-projects, the shape Layer B certifies) admitted through cell-admin
# on compute-1g.env + shared-cell.env (one shard, fleet off, the 8 MiB ring,
# 32/16 MiB caches, k = 8), each with its own token: 3 streams, 200 appends
# a day of 400 B JSON singles, one long-poll tail always connected. s3lite
# at 20 ms. TOKIO_WORKERS=2 is what the binary runs on a 1-vCPU instance
# (one per core, never below two: src/config/model.rs worker_threads), not
# this host's 20.
#
# About 40 minutes: admission (a minute or two at 1,000 projects), the
# manifest's 1,640 s (setup 0-120 s, the load from 180 s, the verdict
# window `period steady` 360-1,560 s), a short quiescence (240 s quiet in
# 60 s windows, given up after 600 s), 60 s of idle tail, the usage read and
# the audit. PACK_SMOKE=1 runs the manifest at time scale 0.15 (about 4 min
# of run, the steady window 180 s) with a short quiescence: for checking a
# setup, not for a verdict.
#
# Verdict: packing.py price RUN (the rig runs it): the instance's month at
# the owner's prices from `period steady`, per tenant, against the K2 bill;
# packing.py curve RUN... sets the steps side by side.
PACK_N=${PACK_N:?set PACK_N to the tenant count: 1, 100, 400 or 1000 (tenants/pack-t-NNNN.json)}
POINT_NAME=PACK-T-$(printf %04d "$PACK_N")
POSTURE=launch
S3LITE_LATENCY_MS=20
SERVERS=1
TENANTS_MANIFEST=bench/k2cost/tenants/pack-t-$(printf %04d "$PACK_N").json
SERVER_ENV_EXTRA="TOKIO_WORKERS=2${SERVER_ENV_EXTRA:+ $SERVER_ENV_EXTRA}"
if [ "${PACK_SMOKE:-0}" = 1 ]; then
  POINT_NAME=$POINT_NAME-smoke
  PHASES="tenants --time-scale 0.15"
  QUIESCE_MIN_SECS=60
  QUIESCE_WINDOW_SECS=20
  QUIESCE_MAX_SECS=240
  IDLE_SECS=20
  USAGE_WAIT_SECS=120
else
  PHASES="tenants"
  QUIESCE_MIN_SECS=240
  QUIESCE_WINDOW_SECS=60
  QUIESCE_MAX_SECS=600
  IDLE_SECS=60
fi
QUIESCE=1
